holder"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Deposits, holds transferable vault shares, and redeems the proportional basket."}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"ERC-173 ownership transfer and the pending-manager extension both clear all authorized executors. Fee-recipient transfer remains two-step. Role transfer cannot cancel a challenge, recover forfeited fees, or change the cooldown."}]]}]
